OL,3,AMeghan joins Harry in Brussels in first
OL,4,Apublic appearance since father's arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duchess of Sussex has made her
OL,7,Ffirst public appearance since her
OL,8,Ffather was charged with possession of
OL,9,Fchild sex abuse material.
OL,11,FMeghan joined her husband Prince Harry
OL,12,Fat the European Parliament in Brussels
OL,13,Fon Tuesday, where he delivered a speech
OL,14,Fcalling for greater protection for
OL,15,Fchildren online.
OL,17,FHarry gave the keynote address alone
OL,18,Fafter Meghan reportedly withdrew from
OL,19,Fspeaking alongside him because she did
OL,20,Fnot feel emotionally strong enough.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
