OL,3,AMeghan joins Harry in Brussels in first
OL,4,Apublic appearance since father's arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe duchess was seen holding her
OL,7,Fhusband's hand tightly as they arrived
OL,8,Fat the Paul-Henri Spaak building. She
OL,9,Fdid not respond to questions from
OL,10,Freporters about how she was feeling.
